{title: Majestic Sweetness Sits Enthroned}
{artist: Samuel Stennett}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
Ma[C]jestic sweetness [F]sits en[C]throned up[F]on the [C]Savior's [G]brow;
his [C]head with radiant [F]glories [C]crowned, his [F]lips with [C]grace o'er[G]flow,
his [C]lips with [F]grace o'er[C]flow.
